  nasaFactTitleEN: NASA Science Fact
  nasaFactEN: NASA studies how light spectrum, fertilization, and controlled environmental conditions affect plant growth in space. The Veg-04A and Veg-04B experiments aboard the ISS found differences in crop yield and nutritional content depending on growing conditions. Optimizing these conditions could improve the productivity of future space greenhouses.
